e":"Step 4:Please answer this question:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b><i>Step 4:<br><\/i><\/b>Please answer this question:<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Step 4:Please answer this question:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The AV stopped because it detected the pedestrians."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":8,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"3":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"4":{"Display":"Neutral"},"5":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"6":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"7":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b><i>Step 4:<br><\/i><\/b>Please answer this question: (this should be what you think WITHOUT explanation)<br>","DataExportTag":"Q51","QuestionID":"QID51"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0cwrilIlfKtG2z4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID52","SecondaryAttribute":"Step 5:Please answer this question:","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b><i>Step 5:<br><\/i><\/b>Please answer this question:<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Step 5:Please answer this question:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"If the AV encounters similar situations in the future, the human passengers should be increasingly cautious."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":8,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"3":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"4":{"Display":"Neutral"},"5":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"6":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"7":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b><i>Step 5:<br><\/i><\/b>Please answer this question:<br>","DataExportTag":"Q52","QuestionID":"QID52"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0cwrilIlfKtG2z4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID53","SecondaryAttribute":"Final Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 Each scenario you see is with a different AV, you should consider them all..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1>Final Instructions&nbsp;<\/h1>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\nEach scenario you see is with a different AV, you should consider them all separately and&nbsp;<i>DO NOT conflate the ability of one AV to the next AV.&nbsp;<\/i>For example, if you think one video demonstrates the AV is very good at detecting a certain concept, you should not assume the AV in the next video is also good at detecting this concept.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nLastly, you will repeatedly be asked if (for example) a&nbsp;<b>bike<\/b>&nbsp;was in the video, and then if the AV&nbsp;<strong><em>detected<\/em><\/strong>&nbsp;the bike. To clarify, just because an object is in front of the AV, it does not mean it&nbsp;<b><i>detected<\/i><\/b>&nbsp;it, so take care to differentiate between the two questions.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYou will only be asked yes\/no questions, if you are not sure, try your best.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Final Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 Each scenario you see is with a different AV, you should consider them all...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<h1>Instructions<\/h1>\n<br>\nYou will be shown 15 scenarios of an automated vehicle (AV) driving around, specifically a self-driving car.<br>\n<br>\nThe videos will be from the point of view of a passenger in the car.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;\n<h2><i>Your task is to:<\/i><\/h2>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<b>Step 1:<\/b> Carefully view the video and imagine yourself in the passenger's position (see screenshot below).<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/mit.co1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_d0v8dUaiRQvflR4\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 406px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>Step 2:<\/b> Read the explanation from the car <em><strong>which helps explain why it drove the way it did <\/strong><\/em>(see screenshot below).<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/mit.co1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_bwMi4i4XAuhAlL0\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 146px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>Step 3:<\/b> Answer the question which asks how strongly you agree with a statement (see screenshot below).<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/mit.co1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_b3GD1zFWyyYaIoS\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 161px;\"><br>\n<br>\n<br><br>","DataExportTag":"Q53","QuestionID":"QID53"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0cwrilIlfKtG2z4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID54","SecondaryAttribute":"Step 1: Please watch this video which shows the passenger's point of view in a self-driving car.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b><i>Step 1: <\/i><\/b><br \/>\nPlease watch this video which shows the passenger&#39;s point of view in a self-driving car.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"625\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/KNA04gh7Dxs\" width=\"770\"><\/iframe>","DefaultChoices":false,"Questi